{"id":1051,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年6月16日下午，马克思主义学院在科艺苑学术报告厅召开全院教职工大会。学院班子成员和全体教职工参会，会议由学院党委副书记、副院长李庆乐主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nzfd7LN7ZL8n2L-llsLlUZLzNsU49WaMlCao7MRLlMVM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8M1hkL1yao7CbMRUaoRVfUzlZnNQkUzAfol7bnR94LzTFM4LZLm67UzVFLzW7Mmn7gjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysL4LigtA8pUHcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7335&e=.png\" source-url=\"/storage/267CF33BB43C173055C014A6067F0F87\" vspace=\"\" alias-label=\"img\" table-source-code=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/346B208F944081AA58FFBA8A9A9D8319/73827DA1/12D64D\" vheight=\"auto\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nzNdDMRv8LmNbM-RrVLm9YLzrfLz6WfnRTko77YMN-Zn770gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYMShRn1y4oRUaozW7Ml7ZL7-ZU8UaL8LDUNlbL77anm6FL8lin77ZMmrFUl7anlMVgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysL4LigtA8pUHcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7335&e=.png\"></p><p>会上，副院长郭玲霞就期末阅卷规范及暑期研修工作作出部署，强调严守工作纪律，确保各项教学环节有序推进。</p><p>院党委副书记李庆乐就学生工作与纪检工作作出专项强调，在充分肯定本学期党建工作成效及学生活动参与度稳步提升的基础上，对严肃期末考风考纪提出了明确要求。</p><p>院长赵笑蕾对学院本学期各项工作开展情况予以总结肯定，围绕课程教学改革、科研项目申报、学院搬迁等重点工作进行安排说明，要求相关工作严格按照时间节点稳妥推进，为下学期各项工作顺利开展筑牢基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2U8ldZUlLYnRlDo-ll4o7LZUmnVM4GWPUmNYMllbLmU8oRv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y8okyPnkyaMRQkMRGiM4GinNVkUNr2LmCPnN-snm6Rn7nFM8r2LRLioz6FLzGDozCZgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysL4LigtA8pUHcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7335&e=.png\" source-url=\"/storage/80AFDEC034E20B5BE9F9E2B05EDE5CC6\" vspace=\"\" alias-label=\"img\" table-source-code=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B481D046B405705FABBEF261FB7F7CDD/7EF03597/106968\" vheight=\"auto\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2LmGdZozCbM4Nbn-RvsUlrRnRWVMl7WiMzM7UzA7Umvso7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8MSyZMShRLllDnNUaLl-DLNV7U4AfLmL4L7CaolQkL4fFnNUZL4CiM4QFoz9ZLm9bgjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysL4LigtA8pUHcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7335&e=.png\"></p><p>院党委书记吴耀金就师德师风建设及学位论文质量保障提出要求，强调师德师风是教师队伍建设的首要标准，必须常抓不懈、融入日常，引导教师以德立身、以德施教。同时，学院将严把论文质量关，确保学位授予工作规范有序。</p><p>会议务实高效，进一步统一了思想，明确了下一阶段重点任务，为学院持续健康发展奠定良好基础。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nzfd7LN7ZL8n2L-llsLlUZLzNsU49WaMlCao7MRLlMVM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8M1hkL1yao7CbMRUaoRVfUzlZnNQkUzAfol7bnR94LzTFM4LZLm67UzVFLzW7Mmn7gjfJQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1ysL4LigtA8pUHcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7335&e=.png"}